1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:05,100
NASA Space Apps, twenty twenty-six.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,600
The challenge: find places on Earth
that analog Moon and Mars bases.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:14,000
ROAMER scores any place on a
common five hundred metre grid,

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,500
shows where the analogy breaks,
and ranks sites by what nobody has studied.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,000
Atacama passes. Pokhara fails.
Kagbeni leads.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Paste coordinates, and it finds
the nearest characterized site.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Find the Moon on Earth.
Prove it with data.
